      "created_at": "2012-04-15T20:08:05.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>No.<br>\nEach ‘instance’ of damage is a separate source, thus it would be reduced by the likes of fortitude (or increased by phosphorescent chamber) but not by shielding winds.</p>\n<p>Shielding winds would work on something like Omnitron’s disintegration ray</p>\n<p>(Looking for a second “You’re right” from one of the designer guys in a single day!)</p>",
